portfolio.buy("TSLA", 10, 8000);
portfolio.sell("TSLA", 10, 7500);    // closed at a $50.00 loss
portfolio.report();
```

produces exactly:

```
PORTFOLIO REPORT
----------------
TSLA       0       $0.00     -$50.00
TOTAL REALIZED: -$50.00
```

