1) `averageMaxTemp` doesn't use the most recent days. I recorded eight days with maxTempC 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 40 (in that order) and then called `averageMaxTemp(1)`; it returned 10.0 instead of 40.0. Similarly, `averageMaxTemp(2)` returned 10.5 instead of 28.0. Once fewer than 7 days are recorded (or I ask for all 7) the numbers look right, which made this hard to spot.

