| --- | --- |
| The text contains no non-ignored lines | `Route plan is empty` |
| First non-ignored line does not start with `ROUTE` | `Line n: expected ROUTE header` |
| Header does not have exactly 6 tokens | `Line n: route header must have 6 tokens` |
| `startTime` is not a valid `HH:MM` | `Line n: invalid start time "T": expected HH:MM` |
| `depotX` or `depotY` is not an integer | `Line n: invalid depot coordinate "C": expected an integer` |
| A later non-ignored line does not start with `STOP` (including a second `ROUTE` line) | `Line n: unknown directive "D": expected STOP` |
| Stop line does not have exactly 7 tokens | `Line n: stop line must have 7 tokens` |
| `index` is not digits-only or is less than 1 | `Line n: invalid stop index "I": expected a positive integer` |
| `index` was already used | `Line n: duplicate stop index I` (numeric value, no quotes) |
| `x` or `y` is not an integer | `Line n: invalid coordinate "C" for stop I: expected an integer` |
