  2000-02-29 exist but 2023-02-29 and 1900-02-29 do not), hour 00–23, minute 00–59.
  The year is any four digits.
- `CODE` on an entry line must be one of the tariff's window codes.
- `centiKwh`: an integer from 0 to 999999 (energy in hundredths of a kWh, written without
  leading `+` or `-`).
- Entries must be in **non-decreasing** timestamp order (equal timestamps allowed).

